abstract: >-
  Code, COCO-format annotations, stored test-set detections, bootstrap outputs, intermediate analysis files and
  figure-generation scripts for a controlled empirical machine-vision study of domain-specific fine-tuning of
  Faster R-CNN for person detection in fixed-camera site-surveillance imagery.
